  "data": {
    "document": "Core Rules",
    "section": "13. Terrain",
    "ruleNumber": "13.08",
    "summary": "For a ranged attack, check every model in the target unit. Being within a terrain area qualifies a model that has INFANTRY, BEASTS or SWARM. So does a terrain feature or Obscuring terrain preventing the attacking model from seeing it in full. Grant Benefit of Cover when all the target’s models qualify. This worsens the attack’s BS by 1. [IGNORES COVER] bypasses it. Stealth, Indirect Shooting and Smokescreen have their own ways to grant it. Under Hit Rolls, an unmodified 6 is a critical hit before comparing the roll with BS.",
